      "message": "I don\u0027t understand how this works: here essentially the value in SCRATCH23 is incremented by `__hw_clock_source_read() / SECOND`, right?\n\nWHat does `__hw_clock_source_read()` return - isn\u0027t it time since resume from deep sleep?",
